      </details>
    ))}
  </section>

  <section class="qa-sources qa-section" aria-labelledby="src-h2">
    <h2 id="src-h2">Sources</h2>
    <ol class="qa-src-list">
      <li id="src-1">Boarman, W.I. & Heinrich, B. (1999). Common Raven (<em>Corvus corax</em>). In Poole, A. (ed.), <em>The Birds of North America</em>, No. 476. Cornell Lab of Ornithology. — pair bond, floater population, communal roosts, information centre hypothesis.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="qa-claim-note"><strong class="claim-science">[science]</strong> peer-reviewed or field-guide data</p>
  </section>

</article>
